  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.2\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.2 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.1\n- Bumped to preview10. No API changes.\n\nv1.0.0-preview9\n- Synchronized package version with the preview9 release.\n\nv1.0.0-preview8\n- Synchronized package version with the preview8 release.\n\nv1.0.0-preview7\n- Synchronized package version with the preview7 Firestore local-cache architecture rework release.\n\nv1.0.0-preview6\n- Synchronized package version with the preview6 release.\n\nv1.0.0-preview5\n- Synchronized package version with the Firestore browser-WASM startup fix.\n- Validated the SDK-owned default HTTP transport with browser platform HttpClient on browser and SocketsHttpHandler off-browser.\n\nv1.0.0-preview4\n- Improved browser-WASM startup compatibility by isolating default HTTP transport initialization.\n\nv1.0.0-preview3\n- Default HTTP transport is now SDK-owned instead of host HttpClientFactory-created.\n- Off-browser transport uses a lazy shared HttpClient backed by SocketsHttpHandler with pooled connection lifetime and cookies disabled.\n- Fixed browser-WASM startup when DI resolves the default HTTP transport before any Firebase request is sent.\n\nv1.0.0-preview2\n- Initial v1.0.0-preview2 package.",
